  "details": "I'm a quest user and i built avatars for android, Windows, and sometimes IOS. I want to turn on things like audio, transparency, etc. if possible. I one day logged in the game and saw my avatar i made was a mess. i looked up the official, saw the video about the camera dolly, and saw that transparency was no longer a thing for quest. At that point, i decided to quit the game, but i really wouldn't want to. I personally want this back and I'm pretty sure a lot of standalone users like my self can have more control over what we can or can't see even if there is down sides. please and thank you",
